From b0b265c5d1793549b632d0aa74c9e7174ddddc08 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Brad White <bradawhite@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 16:51:33 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Sidephone defaults: Levyra SP

Lighter first-run defaults for the Sidephone SP-01 (2.8-inch screen, quad-core
Cortex-A53): Performance engine Smooth, animations, Player Canvas, dynamic
color and Liquid Glass off, Gallery visual mode on a dark player background,
Compact Home with the Resonance, Trending artists and Charts rows off, and
Levyra Enhanced Audio off so playback can use the audio offload path.
Every setting stays available in Settings.

Separate application id (com.bradwhite.levyrasp) and launcher name (Levyra SP)
so it installs beside upstream Levyra; version 2.6.9-sp1.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JZ8GVqSvs8ATepLvBc2zrq
